      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DELIGHTFUL MIKI (8) settled handy then assumed control and didn't give in but was overhauled in the run home to finish second last start over 2180m at Kilmore, continuing the strong form in recent times. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. Needs to be at her best to beat this field but she good enough to play a major role. MISS ADDI (5) was a neck away in second at Cranbourne over 1609m last start at her first run back from a spell. Meets some better types this time but a win is on the cards. MILOLA ROCK (3) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 2100m at Charlton. Include from the low draw. HELLAVA DEAL (2) finished just 2 metres away over 2190m at Mildura last start. Strips fitter third-up and can improve.",
